# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/

### Dependencies ###
# Lockfiles and local packages for various package managers
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions
.pnpm-debug.log*

### Build & Cache ###
# Build outputs and caches from Next.js, TypeScript, and other tools
/.next/
/out/
/build
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

### IDE & Editor ###
# Visual Studio / .NET specific files
.vs/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
ClientOnApplication/.vs/

### OS & Miscellaneous ###
# macOS specific files
.DS_Store

# Vercel hosting platform
.vercel

### Logs ###
# General log files for various package managers
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

### Testing ###
# Test coverage reports
/coverage

### Sensitive & Environment Files ###
# Environment variables - should not be committed
.env*

# Private keys
*.pem